# Due Diligence on Bot1's Ornithopter: "Enchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has vigilance" for as long as the Aura is there, and the enters trigger gives "target
# creature you control other than enchanted creature" +2/+2 and vigilance until end of turn. Bot1's second Ornithopter is the only legal target (the enchanted one is
# excluded, Bot2's is not Bot1's): it is 2/4 with vigilance this turn and 0/2 again on turn 3, while the enchanted one stays 2/4 with vigilance.

